            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of the Methane-Oxidizing Bacterium &quot;Candidatus Methylomonas sp. LWB&quot; Isolated from Movile Cave.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01491-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01491-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the draft genome sequence of &quot;Candidatus Methylomonas sp. LWB&quot; isolated from Movile Cave microbial mat samples. The genome contains both the soluble and particular methane monooxygenase; however, one of the putative particulate methane monooxygenase gene clusters is ordered pmoABC rather than in the canonical gene arrangement of pmoCAB.</AbstractText>
